              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ana Emperatriz"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This has been my best banana loaf yet!!! This recipe is amazing, super easy and no complications. I made double the recipe and made one leaf with chocolate chips, another loaf with walnuts and the rest in cupcake size. What a hit!\n\nI made a few changes to the original recipe: 1) added brown sugar instead of white; 2) I added a little bit more banana (the recipe calls for 3, but since I was making double and I had 7 ripped bananas I just used 7 without changing anything else! I think that's why it turned out better!); 3) used unsalted butter. \n\nAll and all you can't go wrong with this AWESOME recipe! Good luck!",
            "datePublished": "2019-08-06T13:46:59.277Z"
          },
